  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1312.19 Back-Up Warning Alarm. Each multipurpose vehicle shall be equipped with a reverse directional alarm or a back-up alarm which has a minimum Dba rating of 97.\n\nSource. #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
